{"id":"d20bc2bc77d088a6","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-left-ce-cut.md","title":"Left-c.e. Reals and Enumerable Left Cuts","display":"thm-left-ce-cut — Left-c.e. Reals and Enumerable Left Cuts","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-left-ce-cut","aliases":["43-thm-left-ce-cut"],"display":"thm-left-ce-cut — Left-c.e. Reals and Enumerable Left Cuts","depends_on":["[[43-df-effective-real-cut]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-leftcomputable]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definition 8.1.3 and Theorem 8.1.4","source_printed_pages":"134","source_pdf_pages":"154","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-left-ce-cut"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-left-ce-cut</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-left-ce-cut — Left-c.e. Reals and Enumerable Left Cuts"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cee54b08acdf9958\" href=\"?note=cee54b08acdf9958\" title=\"43-df-effective-real-cut\">43-df-effective-real-cut</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 8.1.3 and Theorem 8.1.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"134"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"154"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\alpha)\">\\(L(\\alpha)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cee54b08acdf9958\" href=\"?note=cee54b08acdf9958\" title=\"43-df-effective-real-cut\">43-df-effective-real-cut</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>，有理数集合按固定有效编码解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(L(\\alpha)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(L(\\alpha)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>递增可计算逼近可枚举所有低于逼近值的有理数；反过来取已枚举有理数的有限最大值产生从下近似。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Definition 8.1.3 and Theorem 8.1.4；印刷页 134，PDF 页 154。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-effective-real-cut","status":"resolved","id":"cee54b08acdf9958","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-real-cut]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-real-cut","status":"resolved","id":"cee54b08acdf9958","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R$；$L(\\alpha)$、$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-effective-real-cut]]、[[43-df-leftcomputable]]。$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]，有理数集合按固定有效编码解释。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R$；$L(\\alpha)$、$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-effective-real-cut]]、[[43-df-leftcomputable]]。$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]，有理数集合按固定有效编码解释。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R$；$L(\\alpha)$、$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-effective-real-cut]]、[[43-df-leftcomputable]]。$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]，有理数集合按固定有效编码解释。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"L(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(L(\\alpha)).","display":true}],"bytes":1401,"bac